"5ae1526e-0e34-42d3-aaab-6b2f5d2da431"],

Cell["8: Exercise 6 again, using conditional evaluation", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"754bce87-b474-4cd4-a379-5c04b6f957f6"],

Cell["\<\
Exercise 6 was already written with \"/;\", so there is nothing to change. It
is repeated here in its Boolean-test form for the record; the two exercises
coincide.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0c428c2f-1daf-4369-8c87-2e3bd96189f1"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
